    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7h4D13",
      "title": "feat(gas-params): 2x gas target for OP Mainnet + OP Sepolia",
      "author": "sbvegan",
      "number": 1446,
      "body": "## Objective\n\n2x the gas target on OP Mainnet (P0) and OP Sepolia, from **10M gas/s → 20M gas/s**, by doubling the block `gasLimit` from `40_000_000` to `80_000_000` while keeping `eip1559Elasticity = 2` and `eip1559Denominator = 250` unchanged:\n\n```\ngasTarget = onchain gasLimit / eip1559Elasticity = 80M / 2 = 40M gas/block  (20M gas/s @ 2s blocks)\n```\n\nProcedure follows the [Raising gas target/limit runbook (RB-180)](https://www.notion.so/13df153ee16280199d3acf26b9a50614).\n\n## OP Mainnet — `src/tasks/eth/053-gas-params-op/`\n\nsuperchain-ops Safe task using the existing `SystemConfigGasParams` template (precedent: `013-gas-params-op`). Executed by the `FoundationUpgradeSafe` (`0x847B…9D92`), which is the OP Mainnet `SystemConfig` owner.\n\n- `gasLimit`: `40_000_000` → **`80_000_000`**\n- `eip1559Elasticity`: `2` (unchanged) / `eip1559Denominator`: `250` (unchanged)\n\n**Simulated** (`just simulate`, forked mainnet) — passes. Only state changes are `SystemConfig` slot `0x68` (gasLimit) and the safe nonce; slot `0x6a` is untouched because `setEIP1559Params(250,2)` re-writes the existing values. Validation hashes are populated in `VALIDATION.md`.\n\n## OP Sepolia — `OP-SEPOLIA-GAS-PARAMS.md`\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> OP Sepolia's `SystemConfig` is owned by an **EOA** (`0xfd1D…5284301`, the registry `SystemConfigOwner`), **not** a Safe — so it cannot be executed via a superchain-ops Safe task. This is a runbook of direct `cast send` commands (same target params) for the EOA owner to run, with pre/post checks and encoded calldata.\n\nDry-run via `eth_call` from the owner EOA succeeds for both `setGasLimit(80000000)` and `setEIP1559Params(250,2)`; a non-owner sender reverts with `Ownable: caller is not the owner`.\n\n## Notes (for reviewers)\n\n- OP Mainnet task `README.md` status is `DRAFT, NOT READY TO SIGN`; the nonce state-override (`57`) and hashes reflect current state and should be refreshed at signing time.\n- The Sepolia `setEIP1559Params` call is a no-op given current values and may be skipped if only the limit is changed.\n- Prerequisite (owned elsewhere): pre-activation performance testing that the chains sustain 20M gas/s.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
